.IX Title "Koha::Database::DataInconsistency 3pm"
.TH Koha::Database::DataInconsistency 3pm "2026-06-25" "perl v5.32.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "NAME"
Koha::Database::DataInconsistency \- Search for data inconsistency in the database
.SH "API"
.IX Header "API"
.SS "invalid_item_library"
.IX Subsection "invalid_item_library"
.Vb 1
\&    Search for items with non\-existent holding or home library.
.Ve
.SS "ids"
.IX Subsection "ids"
.Vb 1
\&    Build a hashref of IDs from a Koha::Object Koha::Objects\-based object.
.Ve
.SS "no_item_type"
.IX Subsection "no_item_type"
.Vb 1
\&    Search for items of biblioitems with non\-existent item type.
.Ve
.SS "invalid_item_type"
.IX Subsection "invalid_item_type"
.Vb 1
\&    Search for items or biblioitems with invalid item type.
.Ve
.SS "errors_in_marc"
.IX Subsection "errors_in_marc"
.Vb 1
\&    Search for bibliographic records with errors in the MARC record.
.Ve
.SS "nonexistent_AV"
.IX Subsection "nonexistent_AV"
.Vb 1
\&    Search for bibliographic frameworks with non\-existent authorised values.
.Ve
.SS "empty_title"
.IX Subsection "empty_title"
.Vb 1
\&    Search for bibliographic records without title defined.
.Ve
.SS "for_biblio"
.IX Subsection "for_biblio"
.Vb 1
\&    Search for possible problems in a given bibliographic record.
.Ve
